<LegalLayout title="Cancellation & Refund Policy" updated="August 2026">

<p>We understand that travel plans can change, and that certain Cappadocia experiences — especially hot air balloon flights — are weather-dependent. This policy explains what happens if you need to cancel, or if we need to cancel due to circumstances beyond our control.</p>

<h2>1. Weather-Related Cancellations (Balloon Flights)</h2>
<div class="highlight-box">
  If your hot air balloon flight is cancelled due to unsafe weather conditions or a decision by the Turkish civil aviation authorities, you will receive a <strong>full 100% refund</strong> of the amount paid, or you may choose to reschedule to the next available date, subject to availability.
</div>
<p>Because balloon flights depend entirely on weather conditions, we recommend booking your flight for the first morning of your stay in Cappadocia — this gives you the opportunity to fly on a following day if your original flight is cancelled.</p>

<h2>2. Cancellations by the Guest</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>More than 48 hours before the tour:</strong> full refund.</li>
  <li><strong>24–48 hours before the tour:</strong> 50% refund.</li>
  <li><strong>Less than 24 hours before the tour, or no-show:</strong> no refund.</li>
</ul>
<p>To cancel or reschedule, please contact us as early as possible via WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/905401015050">+90 540 101 50 50</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@kapheratravel.com">info@kapheratravel.com</a>, quoting your booking reference.</p>

<h2>3. Cancellations by CappadociaGo</h2>
<p>In the rare event that we need to cancel a confirmed tour for operational reasons (not related to weather or force majeure), you will be offered either a full refund or an alternative tour of equal or greater value at no additional cost.</p>

<h2>4. Refund Processing Time</h2>
<p>Approved refunds are processed to the original payment method within 5–10 business days. The exact time for the refund to appear on your statement depends on your card issuer or bank.</p>

<h2>5. Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
<p>Refunds will not be issued where: the guest fails to arrive at the confirmed pickup point at the agreed time; the guest is refused participation due to safety concerns (e.g. intoxication, medical contraindications not disclosed at booking); or the guest voluntarily leaves the tour before completion.</p>

<h2>6. Package &amp; Multi-Day Tours</h2>
<p>For package tours involving accommodation or multiple activities, cancellation terms may vary by component (e.g. hotel cancellation policies may differ from tour cancellation policies). Specific terms will be confirmed at the time of booking for these packages.</p>

<h2>7. How to Request a Refund or Rescheduling</h2>
<p>Contact our team via WhatsApp or email with your name, booking date, and tour name. We aim to respond and confirm next steps within a few hours during business hours.</p>

</LegalLayout>
